Spec: SpecDD Annotator

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Convert SpecDD validation issues into IntelliJ editor annotations.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDAnnotator.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDAnnotator.kt

Can read:
  ./SpecDDStructureValidator.kt
  ./SpecDDValidationResult.kt
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/validation/SpecDDAnnotatorBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Validate only PSI files.
  Validate only files whose file type is `SpecDDFileType`.
  Ignore non-file PSI elements.
  Ignore non-SpecDD PSI files.
  Validate file text through `SpecDDStructureValidator`.
  Create IntelliJ annotations with `HighlightSeverity.ERROR`.
  Use each issue display message for the annotation message.
  Use each issue range for the annotation range.
  Expose direct text annotation support for focused tests.
  Cover direct text, non-file elements, non-SpecDD files, and SpecDD files in tests.

Must not:
  Run syntax highlighting.
  Define validation rules directly.
  Create warnings for validation issues.
  Add quick fixes or settings UI.
